# Point the editor at a Supabase project.
#
# Leave these out and the editor runs exactly as it did before any database
# existed: one project, in this browser, saved and loaded as a file. The
# client is not even bundled — 218 KB that a build without a database does
# not carry.
#
# Local: `npm run db:start` prints both. Deployed: Project settings →
# Environment Variables, then redeploy. The anon key is meant to be public;
# the service role key is not, and never belongs in anything VITE_ prefixed.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
